# Phoenix Portal

Read `HANDOFF.md` at the repository root before any change. It has the
project map, the build and release steps, the signing key setup, open
decisions and known flaky tests.

Rules the owner set (details in HANDOFF.md):

- Work and ship on `main`. Until the owner deletes the old branch
  `claude/fervent-hopper-25a7jk`, also push each `main` commit to it
  (`git push origin main:claude/fervent-hopper-25a7jk`). Never force-push,
  rewrite history or delete branches without the owner's OK.
- Sign every APK with the release key (`app/android/key.properties`,
  certificate SHA-256 starting `47fff989d4`). Never commit the key, key
  files or any APK.
- Ship builds as GitHub Releases with `install/publish_release.sh` after
  bumping the version in `app/pubspec.yaml` and running
  `install/make_releases.py`; never commit an APK.
- Nothing may be sent to the original Kiosk Satellite project (no analytics,
  links or update checks to it).
- Keep the CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 licence, the "Based on Kiosk Satellite by Xavier
  Larrea" credit and Immortal's MIT notice. Do not relicense.
- Ask before uninstalling, disabling or deleting anything on a Portal.
- Keep the calm look: wallpaper and frosted glass (`PhoenixGlassPage`,
  `PhoenixPageBackdrop` in `app/lib/ui/home/home_glass.dart`), softened
  colours (`Phx` tokens in `app/lib/ui/theme.dart`, `kidsSoft()` for Kids).
  No loud saturated fills.
- Kids content: no copyrighted characters or songs; English only.
- Before shipping: `flutter analyze lib test`, the tests for what changed
  (`app/test/kids_all_games_test.dart` for any Kids game), and the admin JS
  tests (`node --test app/test/*_test.mjs`).
